{
  "_comment": "WS-J fixture: the jvm-* advice of docs/v0.4/SPEC.md 6 (conditions as amended), without requires, so the current Recommender evaluates it until WS-R's bundled content lands. Texts are placeholders; the bundled rules' own wording is WS-R's.",
  "advice": [
